se tracking-wider text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-1\">\n          <i data-lucide=\"truck\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i> 차량 점검 및 특이사항\n        </span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\">\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 mb-1\">차량 번호</label>\n          <select id=\"select-vehicle\"\n            class=\"w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-2 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800\">\n            <option value=\"81두1580 (탑차)\" selected>81두1580 (탑차)</option>\n            <option value=\"89보4028 (탑차)\">89보4028 (탑차)</option>\n            <option value=\"90너4889 (탑차)\">90너4889 (탑차)</option>\n            <option value=\"71고4405 (스타렉스)\">71고4405 (스타렉스)</option>\n            <option value=\"76마3422 (스타렉스)\">76마3422 (스타렉스)</option>\n            <option value=\"81도5958 (스타렉스)\">81도5958 (스타렉스)</option>\n            <option value=\"81도8458 (스타렉스)\">81도8458 (스타렉스)</option>\n            <option value=\"81루5100 (스타렉스)\">81루5100 (스타렉스)</option>\n            <option value=\"84저1259 (스타렉스)\">84저1259 (스타렉스)</option>\n            <option value=\"90서8616 (스타렉스)\">90서8616 (스타렉스)</option>\n            <option value=\"91주8839 (스타렉스)\">91주8839 (스타렉스)</option>\n            <option value=\"95가0175 (스타렉스)\">95가0175 (스타렉스)</option>\n            <option value=\"95가0200 (스타렉스)\">95가0200 (스타렉스)</option>\n            <option value=\"개인차량 (스타렉스)\">개인차량 (스타렉스)</option>\n            <option value=\"개인차량-이병국 (스타렉스)\">개인차량-이병국 (스타렉스)</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 mb-1\">주행거리 (km)</label>\n          <input type=\"number\" id=\"input-mileage\" placeholder=\"예: 70\"\n            class=\"w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"p-2.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-700\">\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n          <span>차량 외관 / 청결도</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-blue-600\">양호 (기본)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n          <span>차량 비고</span>\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"input-vehicle-note\" placeholder=\"차량 특이사항 기입\"\n            class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-xs w-44\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <label class=\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 mb-1\">작업 특이사항 (비고 / Remark)</label>\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"input-note\" placeholder=\"특이사항 기입\"\n          class=\"w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-xs text-slate-800\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 9. Submit Button -->\n    <div class=\"pt-2\">\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"btn-submit\"\n        class=\"w-full py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-700 text-white font-extrabold text-base rounded-2xl shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/30 hover:brightness-110 active:scale-95 transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n        <i data-lucide=\"send\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n        <span>＋ 작업 목록에 추가</span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 10. 최근 저장된 내역 (실시간 리스트) -->\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80 p-4 space-y-3\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2\">\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600 flex items-center gap-1\">\n          <i data-lucide=\"history\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i> 당일 저장된 최근 내역\n        </span>\n        <button type=\"button\" id=\"btn-refresh-history\"\n          class=\"text-xs text-blue-600 hover:underline flex items-center gap-0.5\">\n          <i data-lucide=\"refresh-cw\" class=\"w-3 h-3\"></i> 새로고침\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"recent-list\" class=\"space-y-2\">\n        <div class=\"text-center py-4 text-xs text-slate-400\">내역 불러오는 중...</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Notification Toast -->\n  <div id=\"toast\"\n    class=\"fixed bottom-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-50 px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 text-white text-xs font-semibold shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 opacity-0 pointer-events-none flex items-center gap-2\">\n    <i data-lucide=\"check-circle\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-blue-400\"></i>\n    <span id=\"toast-msg\">저장되었습니다.</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\nfunction methodChoices(config, method) {\n  const catalog=(config.method_catalog||{})[method];\n  return catalog||{inventory:[],materials:[],main:[],aux:[]};\n}\nfunction matchingMaterialRows(config,method,label){\n  return methodChoices(config,method).inventory.filter(row=>row.role==='material'&&\n    [row.name,[row.name,row.model].filter(Boolean).join(' '),row.model?row.name+' ('+row.model+')':row.name].includes(label));\n}\nfunction selectedMaterialLabel(){\n  const custom=document.getElementById('input-custom-mat');\n  return custom&&!custom.classList.contains('hidden')?custom.value.trim():(document.getElementById('select-material')?.value||'');\n}\nfunction setMaterialPanelVisibility(visible,historical=false){\n  const wrapper=document.getElementById('material-input-wrap');\n  const notice=document.getElementById('material-history-notice');\n  if(wrapper)wrapper.classList.toggle('hidden',!visible);\n  if(notice)notice.classList.toggle('hidden',!historical);\n}\nfunction renderManualMaterialControls(){\n  const manual=document.getElementById('workspace-manual-link');\n  const fields=document.getElementById('workspace-manual-fields');\n  if(fields)fields.hidden=!(manual&&manual.checked);\n}\nfunction syncMaterialConnection(){\n  const link=document.getElementById('workspace-material-id');\n  if(!link)return '';\n  const manual=document.getElementById('workspace-manual-link');\n  const wrapper=document.getElementById('workspace-warehouse-wrap');\n  renderManualMaterialControls();\n  if(manual&&manual.checked){if(wrapper)wrapper.hidden=true;return link.value;}\n  const material=selectedMaterialLabel();\n  const rows=matchingMaterialRows(appConfig,selectedMethod,material);\n  const warehouse=document.getElementById('workspace-warehouse');\n  if(rows.length>1){\n    replaceMethodOptions(warehouse,rows.map(row=>({value:row.id,label:[row.warehouse,row.company,row.model].filter(Boolean).join(' / ')})),'창고·품목을 선택하세요');\n    if(wrapper)wrapper.hidden=false;\n    link.value=warehouse?warehouse.value:'';\n  }else{\n    if(wrapper)wrapper.hidden=true;\n    if(warehouse)warehouse.value='';\n    link.value=rows.length===1?rows[0].id:'';\n  }\n  return link.value;\n}\nfunction materialConnectionForSave(material){\n  const id=syncMaterialConnection();\n  const manual=document.getElementById('workspace-manual-link');\n  if(!(manual&&manual.checked)&&matchingMaterialRows(appConfig,selectedMethod,material).length>1&&!id){\n    throw new Error('같은 자재가 여러 창고에 있습니다. 창고·품목을 선택하세요.');\n  }\n  return id;\n}\nfunction restoreMaterialConnection(id,manualRequested=false){\n  const manual=document.getElementById('workspace-manual-link');\n  const material=selectedMaterialLabel();\n  const rows=matchingMaterialRows(appConfig,selectedMethod,material);\n  if(material)setMaterialPanelVisibility(true,methodChoices(appConfig,selectedMethod).materials.length===0);\n  if(manual)manual.checked=Boolean(manualRequested)||(Boolean(id)&&!rows.some(row=>row.id===String(id)));\n  if(id)workspaceSelectValue(document.getElementById('workspace-material-id'),id);\n  const warehouse=document.getElementById('workspace-warehouse');\n  if(warehouse&&rows.length>1){replaceMethodOptions(warehouse,rows.map(row=>({value:row.id,label:[row.warehouse,row.company,row.model].filter(Boolean).join(' / ')})),'창고·품목을 선택하세요');warehouse.value=id||'';}\n  syncMaterialConnection();\n}\nfunction replaceMethodOptions(field,choices,placeholder,preserve=true){\n  if(!field)return;\n  const current=selectedMethodValues(field);\n  field.replaceChildren(new Option(placeholder,''));\n  choices.forEach(choice=>field.add(new Option(choice.label,choice.value)));\n  if(preserve)setMethodValues(field,current.filter(value=>choices.some(choice=>choice.value===value)));\n}\nfunction selectedMethodValues(field){\n  if(!field)return [];\n  if(field.multiple&&field.selectedOptions)return Array.from(field.selectedOptions).map(option=>option.value).filter(Boolean);\n  return field.value?[field.value]:[];\n}\nfunction setMethodValues(field,values){\n  if(!field)return;\n  const wanted=new Set((Array.isArray(values)?values:String(values||'').split(';')).map(value=>String(value).trim()).filter(Boolean));\n  if(field.multiple)Array.from(field.options).forEach(option=>{option.selected=wanted.has(option.value);});\n  else field.value=Array.from(wanted)[0]||'';\n  if(typeof field._mobileMultiRefresh==='function')field._mobileMultiRefresh();\n}\nfunction collectMainEquipment(){return Array.from(new Set(selectedMethodValues(document.getElementById('select-equip')))).join('; ');}\nfunction pautAuxCategory(label){\n  const text=String(label||'').toUpperCase();\n  if(/SCANNER|스캐너|COBRA|MICROBE|BTG006/.test(text))return 'scanner';\n  if(/PAUT\\s+PROBE\\s*-\\s*WEDGE|PAUT.*(?:웨지|웻지)|(?:WEDGE|웨지|웻지).*PAUT/.test(text))return 'wedge';\n  if(/PAUT\\s+PROBE(?:\\s*\\(|$)|PAUT.*탐촉자/.test(text))return 'probe';\n  return '';\n}\nfunction refreshPautEquipmentChoices(method,auxChoices){\n  const panel=document.getElementById('paut-equipment-grid');\n  const mainWrap=document.getElementById('main-equipment-wrap');\n  const auxWrap=document.getElementById('aux-equipment-wrap');\n  const label=document.getElementById('aux-equipment-label');\n  const isPaut=method==='PAUT';\n  if(panel){panel.classList.toggle('hidden',!isPaut);panel.style.order=isPaut?'2':'';}\n  if(mainWrap)mainWrap.style.order=isPaut?'1':'';\n  if(auxWrap){auxWrap.style.order=isPaut?'3':'';auxWrap.classList.toggle('col-span-2',isPaut);}\n  if(label)label.textContent=isPaut?'기타 보조장비':'보조 장비/스캐너';\n  const groups={scanner:[],probe:[],wedge:[]};\n  auxChoices.forEach(value=>{const category=pautAuxCategory(value);if(category)groups[category].push({value,label:value});});\n  replaceMethodOptions(document.getElementById('select-paut-scanner'),groups.scanner,'스캐너 선택 안 함');\n  replaceMethodOptions(document.getElementById('select-paut-probe'),groups.probe,'탐촉자 선택 안 함');\n  replaceMethodOptions(document.getElementById('select-paut-wedge'),groups.wedge,'웻지 선택 안 함');\n  return isPaut?auxChoices.filter(value=>!pautAuxCategory(value)):auxChoices;\n}\nfunction collectAuxEquipment(){\n  const values=[];\n  if(selectedMethod==='PAUT'){\n    ['select-paut-scanner','select-paut-probe','select-paut-wedge'].forEach(id=>values.push(...selectedMethodValues(document.getElementById(id))));\n  }\n  const others=selectedMethodValues(document.getElementById('select-aux-equip'));\n  if(others.includes('✏️ 직접 입력...')){\n    const custom=document.getElementById('input-custom-aux')?.value.trim()||'';\n    if(custom)values.push(...custom.split(';').map(value=>value.trim()).filter(Boolean));\n  }\n  values.push(...others.filter(value=>value!=='✏️ 직접 입력...'&&value!=='없음'));\n  return Array.from(new Set(values)).join('; ');\n}\nfunction restoreAuxEquipment(text){\n  const values=String(text||'').split(';').map(value=>value.trim()).filter(Boolean);\n  const assigned=new Set();\n  if(selectedMethod==='PAUT'){\n    for(const [category,id] of [['scanner','select-paut-scanner'],['probe','select-paut-probe'],['wedge','select-paut-wedge']]){\n      const matches=values.filter(item=>!assigned.has(item)&&pautAuxCategory(item)===category);\n      if(matches.length){setMethodValues(document.getElementById(id),matches);matches.forEach(value=>assigned.add(value));}\n    }\n  }\n  const remaining=values.filter(value=>!assigned.has(value));\n  const aux=document.getElementById('select-aux-equip');\n  const custom=document.getElementById('input-custom-aux');\n  const known=remaining.filter(value=>aux&&Array.from(aux.options).some(option=>option.value===value));\n  const unknown=remaining.filter(value=>!known.includes(value));\n  if(aux)setMethodValues(aux,unknown.length?[...known,'✏️ 직접 입력...']:known);\n  if(custom){custom.value=unknown.join('; ');custom.classList.toggle('hidden',!unknown.length);}\n}\nfunction refreshMethodChoices(method){\n  const choices=methodChoices(appConfig,method);\n  replaceMethodOptions(document.getElementById('workspace-material-id'),\n    choices.inventory.map(r=>({value:r.id,label:[r.name,r.model,r.warehouse].filter(Boolean).join(' / ')})),\n    choices.inventory.length?'재고 연결 안 함':'관련 재고 품목 없음');\n  replaceMethodOptions(document.getElementById('select-material'),\n    choices.materials.map(value=>({value,label:value})),choices.materials.length?'자재 선택 안 함':'관련 소모품 없음');\n  setMaterialPanelVisibility(choices.materials.length>0,false);\n  if(!choices.materials.length){\n    const customMaterial=document.getElementById('input-custom-mat');\n    if(customMaterial){customMaterial.value='';customMaterial.classList.add('hidden');}\n  }\n  replaceMethodOptions(document.getElementById('select-equip'),\n    choices.main.map(value=>({value,label:value})),choices.main.length?'주 장비 선택':'등록된 관련 주 장비 없음');\n  const otherAux=refreshPautEquipmentChoices(method,choices.aux);\n  replaceMethodOptions(document.getElementById('select-aux-equip'),\n    otherAux.map(value=>({value,label:value})).concat([{value:'✏️ 직접 입력...',label:'✏️ 직접 입력...'}]),'보조장비 선택 안 함');\n  const custom=document.getElementById('input-custom-aux');\n  if(custom&&!selectedMethodValues(document.getElementById('select-aux-equip')).includes('✏️ 직접 입력...')){\n    custom.value='';custom.classList.add('hidden');\n  }\n  const manual=document.getElementById('workspace-manual-link');\n  if(manual)manual.checked=false;\n  syncMaterialConnection();\n}\nfunction applyMethodDefaults(method){\n  const defaults={PAUT:['PAUT MX2(OMNI2-103085)',''],RT:['Se-75','ADR, SURVEY, 콜리메타'],MT:['Yoke','자분살포기'],PT:['PT 약품','조도계'],UT:['','']};\n  const desired=defaults[method]||['',''];\n  ['select-equip','select-aux-equip'].forEach((id,i)=>{\n    const field=document.getElementById(id);\n    if(field&&!selectedMethodValues(field).length&&Array.from(field.options).some(o=>o.value===desired[i]))setMethodValues(field,[desired[i]]);\n  });\n  if(method==='PAUT'){\n    const scanner=document.getElementById('select-paut-scanner');\n    if(scanner&&!selectedMethodValues(scanner).length){const preferred=Array.from(scanner.options).find(option=>/PAUT SCANNER \\(MANUAL\\)/i.test(option.value));if(preferred)setMethodValues(scanner,[preferred.value]);}\n  }\n}\n</script>\n\n  <script>\n    // Visual error diagnostics on mobile screens\n    window.onerror = function (msg, url, line, col, error) {\n      try {\n        var b = document.getElementById(\"mobile-error-banner\");\n        if (!b) {\n          b = document.createElement(\"div\");\n          b.id = \"mobile-error-banner\";\n          b.style.cssText = \"position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:999999;background:#b91c1c;color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);word-break:break-all;\";\n          document.body.prepend(b);\n        }\n        b.innerHTML = \"⚠️ 모바일 스크립트 오류: \" + msg + \" (\" + line + \"줄)\";\n      } catch (e) { }\n      return false;\n    };\n\n    // Safe Lucide icon initializer that never throws on slow/blocked mobile CDN\n    function safeCreateIcons() {\n      try {\n        if (typeof lucide !== 'undefined' && lucide && typeof lucide.createIcons === 'function') {\n          lucide.createIcons();\n        }\n      } catch (e) {\n        console.warn(\"lucide icons error:\", e);\n      }\n    }\n\n    const DEFAULT_CONFIG = {\n      companies: [\"한국지역난방공사 중앙지사\", \"한국지역난방공사\", \"중앙지사\"],\n      loc_types: [\"열수송관\", \"플랜트(관리소)\", \"열배관\", \"핫태핑\"],\n      users: [\n     